        ↓
Store playlist URL
        ↓
Dispatch Job (Fetch Videos)
        ↓
YouTube API (Pagination)
        ↓
Save in DB
        ↓
Cron Job (Auto Sync)
        ↓
Update DB
        ↓
Student watches videos
        ↓
Update progress table
        ↓
Frontend API shows everything


